# Implementation of a Consistent Dynamic Game World in a Text Adventure Based on Large Language Models

## My interpretation of the brief

The project is a text adventure game where an LLM generates the story while the program keeps the game world and its state consistent.

## Why I am a good fit for this project

I am interested in AI, games, and interactive applications. I would like to learn how LLMs can be used to create a dynamic game.

## Relevant experience and background

I have basic programming knowledge from my Computer Science Engineering studies and I am motivated to learn new technologies.

## Proposed approach

I would first build a simple text adventure and game state, then integrate an LLM for dynamic story generation and add saving and consistency handling.

## Initial plan

1. Define the game world and basic rules.
2. Build a simple text adventure.
3. Add the LLM.
4. Add saving and consistency handling.
5. Test the system.

## Additional information

I plan to use Git from the beginning and develop the project step by step.
